:: Take Amulet
<<set $has_amulet to true>>
<<set $amulet_recovered to true>>
<<set $inventory.push("Amulet of Thornwood")>>
<<set $xp += 200>>

# The Amulet of Thornwood

You reach out and take the amulet. The green glow flares, then dims. The air in the clearing shifts -- the oppressive feeling lifts, replaced by a quiet calm. The eerie lights in the forest should stop now.

''Received: Amulet of Thornwood.'' 200 XP earned.

The amulet is warm in your hand. You feel a faint connection to the land -- as if the forest itself acknowledges you.

You should return to Mara. She'll want to see this.

<<set $quest_artifact to "completed">>

''Quest Completed: The Ancient Amulet''
Rewards: 200 XP, Amulet of Thornwood

<<if $quest_wolf_problem == "completed" and $quest_lost_traveler == "completed">>
All three main quests are complete. Return to Mara to discuss the final step.

